kpi Store rating | 4.4

## Launch week

data dau = day,daily active users; Mon,268000; Tue,331000; Wed,369000; Thu,412000; Fri,398000
chart line dau y=daily active users title="Daily active users" mark="Tue Hotfix 1.0.1" mark="Wed Servers doubled" mark="Thu Store feature"

- **Monday:** the login queue peaked at 22,000 players at 14:20. We added auth capacity to clear it.
- **Tuesday:** hotfix 1.0.1 shipped, fixing a launch crash on Android 12 devices. Crash-free sessions went from 97.6% to 99.0%.
- **Wednesday:** we doubled server capacity to 120 game servers.
- **Thursday:** the store featured the game in 14 countries, and daily players hit the week's peak of 412,000.
- **Friday:** we announced the first weekend event, starting 2026-10-17.

